  "decision": "2026-10-23, project owner: cap per-connection synapse counts, calibrated at rest only, instead of global short-term depression (which failed the sugar->MN9 validation). The cap value has no direct citation; Liu et al. (2022) Curr Biol 32:559, doi 10.1016/j.cub.2021.11.056 show connection strength follows synapse density, not raw count, so raw counts overstate the largest connections.",
